From f690ce43878a33a53f2bba3fc13e4313b2401b03 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Moritz Angermann <moritz@zw3rk.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:37:09 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] typecheck: implement TypeFamilies, DataKinds, and GADT
 constraint propagation

Refs: https://github.com/augustss/MicroHs/issues/367
Refs: https://github.com/augustss/MicroHs/issues/446
Refs: https://github.com/augustss/MicroHs/issues/226
Refs: https://github.com/augustss/MicroHs/issues/449
Refs: https://github.com/augustss/MicroHs/issues/501
Refs: https://github.com/augustss/MicroHs/issues/502

Implement open, closed, associated, and injective type/data families,
coincident type instance deduplication, higher-kinded associated family arity,
cyclic b ~ F b superclass equality orientation, DataKinds promoted
constructors and kind checking, and extended GADT/existential/local
constraint propagation proven at scale on GHC 9.14 Stage 1 (Trees That Grow).
